// Your MapTiler key. Copy this file to Secrets.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and
// replace the value. See docs/ios-plan.md §5.1 for what the key must allow.
MAPTILER_API_KEY =

// Your Apple Developer team, needed to build onto a physical device: an empty
// team means simulator-only. Leave it empty if you have not got one yet.
//
// A free Personal Team is enough for your own iPhone, and Xcode creates it for
// you the first time you sign in — Settings → Accounts → Apple ID → Manage. Its
// ID is 10 characters, and the same Personal Team is reused for every free
// account on the machine. Two consequences worth knowing:
//
//   - Its provisioning profile expires after 7 days, so the app has to be
//     reinstalled weekly. A paid account gives a year.
//   - It is per-machine, so this is deliberately not committed: it lives in this
//     gitignored file and project.yml reads it as $(DEVELOPMENT_TEAM).
//
// A quick way to read the ID back if Xcode is being unhelpful:
//   defaults read com.apple.dt.Xcode IDEProvisioningTeams
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
